    "semanticRules": [
      "`PK(reference_id,reference_revision)`及`UNIQUE(workspace_id,material_handle_id,reference_revision)`",
      "typed Handle JSON固定`WorkspaceMaterialHandle@1`且≤`4 KiB`，Episode claims JSON固定`LibraWorkspaceEpisodeClaims@1`且≤`16 KiB`，完整保存`0..32`项本节typed Episode claim并重算同一scope digest",
      "Handle必须与`fx_workspace_materials.handle_schema_ref/json/digest/fence_digest`及Decision逐字节一致后冻结，允许Foundation material后来reclaimed仍重建历史Reference。Verification四列在working全NULL",
      "product_staging全非NULL且schema固定`WorkspaceProductVerificationSnapshot@1`、canonical JSON≤`16 KiB`、ID/digest逐字节匹配",
      "released逐字节沿用前一revision四列：由working释放时全NULL，由product_staging释放时全非NULL，不能清空或替换。每次Reference transition与同一事务Workspace revision一一绑定，历史Workspace revision N按`committed_workspace_revision<=N`选择每个stream最高Reference revision重建set",
      "每个reference stream从1连续、append-only，最高revision是current",
      "同一stream后续revision的Handle、materialKey与Episode claims逐字节沿用",
      "同一Workspace最多1024个current non-released Reference且同一materialKey至多一个，防止Cleanup无法形成完整Scope或hard-link Handle对同一Control重复release",
      "released不得再回到前态",
      "同一handle不能同时存在两个current role",
      "只引用同Workspace的`fx_workspace_materials`"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`workspace_id FK, libra_run_id FK, reference_id, material_handle_id, material_key, workspace_handle_schema_ref, workspace_handle_json, workspace_handle_digest, reference_revision, reference_state(working|product_staging|released), episode_claims_schema_ref, episode_claims_json, episode_scope_digest, product_verification_schema_ref NULL, product_verification_id NULL, product_verification_json NULL, product_verification_digest NULL, previous_reference_revision NULL, committed_workspace_revision, reference_digest, committed_at_ms`",
      "constraints": "`PK(reference_id,reference_revision)`及`UNIQUE(workspace_id,material_handle_id,reference_revision)`；typed Handle JSON固定`WorkspaceMaterialHandle@1`且≤`4 KiB`，Episode claims JSON固定`LibraWorkspaceEpisodeClaims@1`且≤`16 KiB`，完整保存`0..32`项本节typed Episode claim并重算同一scope digest；Handle必须与`fx_workspace_materials.handle_schema_ref/json/digest/fence_digest`及Decision逐字节一致后冻结，允许Foundation material后来reclaimed仍重建历史Reference。Verification四列在working全NULL；product_staging全非NULL且schema固定`WorkspaceProductVerificationSnapshot@1`、canonical JSON≤`16 KiB`、ID/digest逐字节匹配；released逐字节沿用前一revision四列：由working释放时全NULL，由product_staging释放时全非NULL，不能清空或替换。每次Reference transition与同一事务Workspace revision一一绑定，历史Workspace revision N按`committed_workspace_revision<=N`选择每个stream最高Reference revision重建set；每个reference stream从1连续、append-only，最高revision是current；同一stream后续revision的Handle、materialKey与Episode claims逐字节沿用；同一Workspace最多1024个current non-released Reference且同一materialKey至多一个，防止Cleanup无法形成完整Scope或hard-link Handle对同一Control重复release；released不得再回到前态；同一handle不能同时存在两个current role；只引用同Workspace的`fx_workspace_materials`"
    },
